{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/pulls/173", "id": 3065064232, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAf7v6M62sSso", "html_url": "https://github.com/rrd4j/rrd4j/pull/173", "diff_url": "https://github.com/rrd4j/rrd4j/pull/173.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/rrd4j/rrd4j/pull/173.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/issues/173", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/pulls/173/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/pulls/173/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/issues/173/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rrd4j/rrd4j/statuses/7d627711d173a7e18bce15bb312a42303d450aae", "number": 173, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Add cleaners to reset RrdBackendFactory to remove order-dependent flakiness in ExportImport.java", "user": {"login": "swj20010308", "id": 103343744, "node_id": "U_kgDOBijmgA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103343744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308", "html_url": "https://github.com/swj20010308", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`RrdBerkleyDbTest` sets a new `RrdBerkeleyDbBackendFactory` without ever reverting to previous factory. Later tests like `ExportImport#testImport` will continue to access this `RrdBerkeleyDbBackendFactory` instead of a default factory, which overrides the `canStore` method and calls `rrdDatabase.getEnvironment()`. This will raise an error because that enviroment is already closed in `RrdBerkleyDbTest`. \r\n\r\nWe can reproduce this issue by running `ExportImport` tests immediately after `RrdBerkleyDbTest`: \r\n\r\n```\r\nmvn -Dtest=org.rrd4j.core.RrdBerkleyDbTest,org.rrd4j.core.jrrd.ExportImport test\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf tests in `ExportImport` run after `RrdBerkleyDbTest`, `activeFactories` will contain the polluted `RrdBerkeleyDbBackendFactory`. \r\n\r\n```\r\nIllegalState Environment is closed\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf these classes run in the opposite order in test enviroment, consider using [iDFlakies](https://github.com/UT-SE-Research/iDFlakies) which would reproduce the problem deterministically. \r\n\r\n```\r\nmvn edu.illinois.cs:idflakies-maven-plugin:2.0.1-SNAPSHOT:detect\r\n```\r\n\r\niDflakies will either fail in `dt.original.orderdt.original.order` with the environment error, or show `ExportImport` as one of the test classes that rely on the order of execution.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nThere are multiple cleaner test classes in the repo that revert `activeFactories` to `getDefaultFactory()`. For example, `TutorialTest.java`. `ExportImport` still passes in `mvn test` because there are cleaner that run between it and `RrdBerkleyDbTest`. To eliminate the problem, we can reuse the same cleaner methods from `TutorialTest` which will revert `RrdBerkeleyDbBackendFactory` back to default.\r\n\r\nThis solution simultaneously fixes all order-dependent flaky tests that are affected by `RrdBerkleyDbTest`.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:03:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-08T08:11:58Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-08T08:11:58Z", "merged_at": "2025-12-08T08:11:58Z", "merge_commit_sha": "5ef12a3345007e19824681d75eb6f1d0cbf18837", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "swj20010308:fix-flaky", "ref": "fix-flaky", "repo": {"id": 1090708812, "node_id": "R_kgDOQQLlTA", "name": "rrd4j", "full_name": "swj20010308/rrd4j", "owner": {"login": "swj20010308", "id": 103343744, "node_id": "U_kgDOBijmgA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103343744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308", "html_url": "https://github.com/swj20010308", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "description": "Public fork for rrd4j", "homepage": "", "language": "Java", "visibility": "public", "is_template": false, "topics": [], "forks_count": 0, "forks": 0, "stargazers_count": 0, "watchers_count": 0, "watchers": 0, "open_issues_count": 1, "open_issues": 1, "size": 6376, "default_branch": "master", "has_issues": false, "has_projects": true, "has_wiki": true, "has_pages": false, "has_downloads": false, "has_discussions": false, "has_pull_requests": true, "pushed_at": "2025-12-02T19:31:27Z", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:07:53Z", "updated_at"